</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/e7cbdf24-7ad0-11f1-949b-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP24355812686063.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/e7cbdf24-7ad0-11f1-949b-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP24355812686063.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">2971b0ae-7acf-11f1-b562-9188a17f314e</guid><pubDate>Wed, 08 Jul 2026 13:43:17 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/e7cbdf24-7ad0-11f1-949b-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP24355812686063.jpg">© 美联社图片</source><dc:creator>弗林</dc:creator></item><item><category>环保天地</category><title>法国近百名科学家联名呼吁制定紧急气候法</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%93%E6%A0%8F%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2/%E7%8E%AF%E4%BF%9D%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0/20260708-%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD%E8%BF%91%E7%99%BE%E5%90%8D%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E5%AE%B6%E8%81%94%E5%90%8D%E5%91%BC%E5%90%81%E5%88%B6%E5%AE%9A%E7%B4%A7%E6%80%A5%E6%B0%94%E5%80%99%E6%B3%95</link><description>
